1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,697
强化学习教科书的三章，
Three chapters of the reinforcement learning textbook,

2
00:00:01,717 --> 00:00:03,980
被一个人写成了赌场闯关。
retold as a casino escape.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,608
10 月 3 号，Pramod Goyal
On October 3, Pramod Goyal finished

4
00:00:05,628 --> 00:00:07,860
几乎熬了个通宵，写完这篇长文。
this long article after almost an all-nighter.

5
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,215
《从零学强化学习》
Reinforcement Learning from Scratch,

6
00:00:09,235 --> 00:00:10,750
第一篇，七千多词。
part 1: over 7,000 words.

7
00:00:10,770 --> 00:00:13,054
发出两天，收藏 1751，
Two days in: 1,751 bookmarks,

8
00:00:13,074 --> 00:00:15,090
是点赞的近两倍。
nearly double its 924 likes.

9
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:16,627
第一关：三台老虎机。
Level one: three slot machines.

10
00:00:16,647 --> 00:00:19,080
多试几次，平均赔率就浮出来。
Try each a few times and its average payout shows up.

11
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,025
赌场加到十台，
The casino adds more, up to ten,

12
00:00:20,045 --> 00:00:21,420
试错一下子变贵了。
and trial and error suddenly gets expensive.

13
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:23,450
办法一：多数时候押最好的，
Fix one: mostly play the best machine,

14
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:24,880
偶尔随机试一台。
and now and then try a random one.

15
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,730
办法二：开局假设每台都赚十块，
Fix two: start by assuming every machine pays ten,

16
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:29,430
逼自己全试一遍。
so you're forced to try them all.

17
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:32,670
办法三：谁试得最少，谁额外加分。
Fix three: the machine you've tried least gets a bonus.

18
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:34,234
赌场夜里改了赔率？
The casino changes the odds overnight?

19
00:00:34,254 --> 00:00:36,620
那就让新数据永远更值钱。
Then make new data count for more.

20
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:37,564
后门是迷宫，
The back door leads to a maze,

21
00:00:37,584 --> 00:00:39,280
墙上贴着一张地图。
with a map pinned on the wall.

22
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:41,411
有地图，机器人一步不用走，
With the map, the robot takes no steps

23
00:00:41,431 --> 00:00:43,350
就能算出每格值多少。
and can still work out what each square is worth.

24
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:45,318
一格值多少？眼前的奖励，
What is a square worth? The reward now,

25
00:00:45,338 --> 00:00:47,630
加上下一格的价值，打个折。
plus the next square's value, discounted.

26
00:00:47,650 --> 00:00:50,520
这叫贝尔曼方程，只用往前看一步。
That's the Bellman equation: it only looks one step ahead.

27
00:00:50,540 --> 00:00:52,947
只改一行，求平均换成取最大，
Change one line, from average to max,

28
00:00:52,967 --> 00:00:54,980
几轮就算出最短出路。
and a few sweeps give the shortest way out.

29
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,470
走出大门才发现，地图是圈套。
Out at the gate, the map turns out to be a trap.

30
00:00:57,490 --> 00:00:59,370
下一篇，没有地图。
Next article: no map.

31
00:00:59,390 --> 00:01:02,015
封面写着“怎么让大模型学会思考”，
The cover says how LLMs learned to think,

32
00:01:02,035 --> 00:01:03,560
但这篇只打地基。
but this part only lays the foundation.

33
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:06,460
每一招，都是上一招失败后逼出来的。
Every trick was forced out by the failure of the last one.
